# The decoder's entry point.
#
# Protocol: stdin gives one line, the input path (natively `/file/<absolute
# path>`). On success stdout gets `FRAME width height ncomp kind` and then
# `NOT_YET SOS`, and the exit status is 0. A refusal is a trap
# `REFUSED CODE: message` on stderr with exit status 1; any other trap is a
# decoder bug. M2 replaces NOT_YET with decoding.

: main ( -- )
  read-line drop source.load markers.open :> j
  j markers.walk
  j markers.frame-line println
  "NOT_YET SOS" println ;
